e(F,524,'三家可进一步了解的东京空间','Existence and thematic resemblance do not prove acceptance of her work.')
e(F,526,'HAGI ART 的公开介绍涉及展览、艺术书和建筑与日常生活等主题，可作为核对展览提案要求的对象。\n\nGallery KAZE 与 Moon Gallery 可用于比较租赁展览的费用和服务。费用表应注明查询日期、展期、销售佣金、值守安排及额外收费；某一时点的空档不代表仍可预约。','Move volatile prices/availability into dated facts; do not imply all are equally suitable, or that her Moon terms equal public rates.')
e(F,548,'HAGI ART：查看展览提案要求与官方联系渠道','Retain exact materials/address only after current route check.')
e(F,551,'Gallery KAZE：查看场地、收费和设备说明','Replace unqualified rate promise with maintained source.')
